------------------------------------------------------------------------
net.bin
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The neural network weights in `net.bin` are a quantized export of
`nnue.npz` from the prophet-nnue project:

    https://github.com/UE2020/prophet-nnue
    Copyright (c) the prophet-nnue authors
    Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0

A copy of the MPL 2.0 is available at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

The export was produced by loading `nnue.npz` with prophet-nnue's own
`QuantizedNNUE::from_built_model`, then writing the resulting i16 arrays
(input weights, input biases, hidden weights, hidden bias) as a sequence
of u32 length-prefixed little-endian arrays. The evaluation code in
`src/engine/nnue.rs` is an independent reimplementation of the forward
pass and is not a copy of prophet-nnue's source.

Because the MPL is a file-level copyleft, `net.bin` remains under the
MPL 2.0 regardless of the terms applied to the rest of this repository.
